-- Sessions append to `reasons`; never edit an older session's entry. The report shows the latest entry.
--
-- BALANCE_MODULES  path from src/shared ("Data/Combat"); `pick` keeps only numbers whose path has one of these
--                  fields, `omit` drops fields of these names at any depth (looks, geometry, duplicated records).
-- CONFIG_KEYS      the only Config fields in the dump (never Config.AdminUserIds).
-- NOT_BALANCE      every other Data module with a one-word reason; `*` stands for one whole path segment.
-- reasons          key of tests/Balance.dataDump ("Combat:monsterHpBase", "Skills/Warrior:[cleave].values.dmg[2]")
--                  or a prefix ending in `*` (only for a new module or a whole table moved at once) ->
--                  { { session = "S<n>", why = "..." }, ... }. A change is explained by an entry of the snapshot's
--                  session or later (tests/Balance.ledger); `Rangi:` keys (ranks) are derived and need none.
-- Every Data file must be on exactly one list (balance.spec "Balance ledger (S83)").

